# Scenario: teaching aid compares common symptom patterns; labels are illustrative, not diagnostic advice.
venn "Symptom overlap: cold, flu, and allergy"
set cold "Common cold"
set flu "Influenza"
set allergy "Seasonal allergy"
cold only: "Runny nose"
flu only: "High fever"
allergy only: "Itchy eyes"
cold & flu: "Fatigue"
cold & allergy: "Sneezing"
flu & allergy: "Headache"
cold & flu & allergy: "Congestion"
